{"reachable": false, "rationale": "Each of the four routes to crownData:exfiltrate is cut. (1) dbReplica:collection needs domainAdmin:privilegeEscalation, which is an AND step requiring the blocked backupHost:lateralMovement, so it fails. (2) codeRepo:collection needs one of serviceAccount, monitoringHost or backupHost. monitoringHost and backupHost are blocked. serviceAccount is an AND step needing rdpLogin:authenticate, which itself needs the blocked memoryDump:credentialAccess. So this route fails. (3) shareMount:collection needs domainAdmin (unreachable) or jumpHost:lateralMovement. jumpHost needs browserStore or memoryDump, and both are blocked. So this route fails. (4) vaultRead:collection needs fileServer, secretsManager or monitoringHost. fileServer needs dbLogin:authenticate (an AND step requiring the blocked browserStore) or the blocked memoryDump. secretsManager is an AND step requiring dbLogin, which is unreachable. monitoringHost is blocked. So this route fails. The target is therefore unreachable."}
```

